  "question": {
    "html": "<p>A conducting coil is rotating in a magnetic field. The graph shows how the induced emf in the coil varies with time</p>\n\n<figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure>\n\n<p>Which of the following gives two times when the magnetic flux through the coil is zero?</p>\n<p></p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\">\n<li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"0\"></span> and <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"t = T\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"t = \\frac{T}{2}\"></span> and <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"t = T\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"t = \\frac{T}{4}\"></span> and <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"t = \\frac{3T}{4}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"t = \\frac{T}{2}\"></span> and <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"t = \\frac{3T}{4}\"></span></li>\n</ol>"
  },
